meta {
  name: Get event volunteers
  type: http
  seq: 11
}

get {
  url: {{restartersBase}}/api/events/{{restartersEventId}}/volunteers?api_token={{process.env.RESTARTERS_TOKEN}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  api_token: {{process.env.RESTARTERS_TOKEN}}
}

docs {
  Who's volunteering at an event. This is an older route outside /api/v2,
  and it needs the token.

  The app lists people with "confirmed": true only. Each one's name is
  volunteer.name, or full_name for someone added by name with no account.
  "status": "2" with "confirmed": false means invited but not yet accepted.

  Set restartersEventId to the event to check. The app uses the group's
  next event from today onwards (today's, if there is one).

  No fixture is saved, because the response includes emails.
}
